    "text": "Yahoo Sports\nwebsite\nAbilene\nCowboys come from behind with three late scores to earn 27-23 victory over Concordia\nBy Brad Anderson, Abilene Reflector-Chronicle, Kan.,\n1 days agoThe Abilene Cowboys came from behind in what was an almost unbelievable fashion to defeat the Concordia Panthers 27-23 on the road Friday night . In a scenario where everything seemingly had to go absolutely right for the Cowboys to overcome their 4th quarter deficit, they would do just that and score three touchdowns in the final seven and half minutes. The final winning touchdown would come with just 31 seconds on the clock with a Taygen Funston 12-yard run.",
